{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-15","name":"プロデューサー","text":"『打ち上げ花火やってるみたいだぞ！』","trans":"“有人在放烟花哦！”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-16","name":"プロデューサー","text":"『遠いけど窓から見える！』","trans":"“虽然远但从窗户能看到！”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2026011040050","name":"ルカ","text":"……\r\nなんでも大はしゃぎだな……","trans":"……\n什么都这么兴奋……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2026011040060","name":"ルカ","text":"……どこだよ","trans":"……在哪儿啊","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-35","name":"プロデューサー","text":"『隣見てくれ！』","trans":"“看旁边！”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2026011040110","name":"ルカ","text":"は、何────","trans":"哈，什么————","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2026011040120","name":"ルカ","text":"（──うわ）","trans":"（——哇）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-41","name":"プロデューサー","text":"（お、ルカ気づいた）","trans":"（哦，路加注意到了）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-42","name":"プロデューサー","text":"（────手でも振っておこう！）","trans":"（————挥个手吧！）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2026011040130","name":"ルカ","text":"……花火見ろよ……","trans":"……看烟花啊……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-52","name":"プロデューサー","text":"！\r\nおお！　ルカ！","trans":"！\n哦哦！　路加！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2026011040160","name":"ルカ","text":"……はしゃぎすぎだろ……","trans":"……你也太兴奋了吧……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-54","name":"プロデューサー","text":"んん？\r\nすまん、聞こえない──","trans":"嗯？\n抱歉，听不见——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2026011040170","name":"ルカ","text":"はしゃぎすぎだろ……！","trans":"太兴奋了吧……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2026011040180","name":"ルカ","text":"……開き直んな","trans":"……别破罐子破摔","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2026011040190","name":"ルカ","text":"なんでもない……！","trans":"没什么……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-68","name":"プロデューサー","text":"──……\r\n夏って感じじゃないか？","trans":"——……\n这不是很有夏天的感觉吗？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2026011040210","name":"ルカ","text":"……なんでアンタと\r\n夏感じてんだって話だけど","trans":"……不过为什么我要跟你\n一起感受夏天啊","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2026011040220","name":"ルカ","text":"──それやめろ\r\nアンタのためにやったわけじゃない","trans":"——别这样\n又不是为了你才做的","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2026011040230","name":"ルカ","text":"だから礼を言われる筋合いもない","trans":"所以我没理由受你道谢","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-76","name":"プロデューサー","text":"はは、なるほど……！\r\n────でも、やっぱりさ","trans":"哈哈，原来如此……！\n————不过，果然还是","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-78","name":"プロデューサー","text":"結果的に俺はこうやって、\r\nルカと花火を見る時間をもらえてるわけだから","trans":"结果我这样，\n得到了和路加一起看烟花的时间","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-79","name":"プロデューサー","text":"そのことに感謝はしたいんだよ","trans":"这一点我想感谢","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-80","name":"プロデューサー","text":"俺のためじゃなくても！","trans":"就算不是为了我！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2026011040260","name":"ルカ","text":"……案外、寄り添う気がないよな","trans":"……你还真是，意外地不想贴近人啊","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-89","name":"プロデューサー","text":"うおっ、そろそろラストなのかな……！？","trans":"哇，差不多要到最后了吧……！？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-91","name":"プロデューサー","text":"ルカ！？\r\nちゃんと見てるか……！？","trans":"路加！？\n有好好看吗……！？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2026011040290","name":"ルカ","text":"……見ないとうるせぇから","trans":"……不看你会啰嗦","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2026011040300","name":"ルカ","text":"この先もずっと、多分こんなんなんだろ","trans":"以后大概也一直会这样吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-97","name":"プロデューサー","text":"うわ、すごいな……！","trans":"哇，好厉害……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2026011040310","name":"ルカ","text":"……本当にな","trans":"……真是啊","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}